From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheKit <thekit@disroot.org>
Date: Mon, 3 Aug 2026 10:01:26 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] surfaceflinger: Render per-task content streams

After each present, re-render every task's layer subtree into that
task's own buffer via the screenshot path, on a dedicated thread.
Layers are grouped by METADATA_TASK_ID from the layer hierarchy;
nested tasks belong to their root task's window. Gated on
persist.waydroid.task_streams.

Prototype for per-app windows: not yet delivered to the hwcomposer,
verify with setprop waydroid.task_streams.dump 1 which writes raw
RGBA to /data/task_streams.

Change-Id: I8a35d3d739b2fb9c8d20868a3069da8f0a9ba44e
